:''Not to be confused with [[Superfeline (Normal Cat)|Superfeline]].''
'''Mightycat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] who was added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]] and can be unlocked when beating the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Puffer Planet (Merciless)|Blue Impact]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] increases speed and grants [[Resistant]], [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]] and [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]].

